<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84248" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποι-ητής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>maker,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχανημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					1.6.38
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					597d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν π. καὶ πατέρα τοῦδε τοῦ παντός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					28c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῴων,</span> of the painter,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				234a
			</span></i>; <i>inventor,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Euthphr.</u>
					3b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμων</span>”
				<i>lawgiver,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Def.</u>
					415b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>workman</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.388.8
			</span></i>, al. (<span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>, pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>composer of a poem, author,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κωμῳδίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					935e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καινῶν δραμάτων, τραγῳδιῶν κτλ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1079.2
				</span></i>
			, al. (<i><span class="en">
				Magn.
			</span></i> Mae., <span class="entity">ii/i B.C.</span>): abs., <i>poet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1030
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ion</u>
				534b
			</span></i>, etc.; Homer was called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ π.,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				485d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1365a11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1380b28
			</span></i>, Teles<i><span class="en">
				p.34
			</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.21.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				26.19
			</span></i>, etc.; so also Hesiod, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				901a
			</span></i>; and others, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Thg.</u>
				125e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				78.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>composer</i> of music, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				812d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>author</i> of a speech, opp. deliverer of it, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. λόγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					305b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				234e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				278e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alcid.
				<u>Soph.</u>
				34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				15.192
			</span></i>. (Written 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποητής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.2319.65
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				711
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>L</u>
				35
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), etc.)</div>
